      ],
      "say": "Hi, I'm Quibble! SAM 3 runs offline through four ONNX files. Here is how they split the work."
    },
    {
      "type": "idea",
      "text": "The export splits SAM 3 into fixed graphs, so the costly image encoder runs once and every click, box or word reuses what it produced.",
